  "details": "If you are editing an animation in the Animation window, and your animation turns on many VRC Constraints, the editor will lag out for several seconds as it applies the preview. The same animation but turning off the constraints causes no lag.\n\nIn the screenshots, \"fly-perched-vr\" lags but \"fly-perched-desktop\" does not.\n\nThis may also be related to: https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1471sdk362-constraints1-unity-editor-heirarchy-selection-inspector-slow But I am submitting as separate because it is a different situation and part of the UI.",
